.TH FOOBAR 1 "" "foobar @VERSION@"
.SH NAME
foobar \- Print a greeting
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B foobar
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B foobar
prints "Hello, world!" followed by a newline to standard output.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the program version and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 0
indicates successful completion.
